      "title": "Tips and Tricks on Hacking with PyTorch: A Quick Tutorial by Brad Heintz",
      "description": "PyTorch is an open-source machine learning framework that is used by both researchers and developers to build, train, and deploy ML systems that solve many different complex challenges. It is continually evolving to make it easier and faster for researchers to go from research exploration to production deployment. In this video, Brad Heintz, a PyTorch Partner Engineer, provides useful tips and tricks for hacking with PyTorch. #PTSH19 https://pytorch.org/",
