      "description": "Torchaudio, a domain library for PyTorch, has been revamped, adding signal processing functionality to make waveform data loading and processing easier. Jason Lian, a PyTorch engineering intern, gives a quick presentation on the torchaudio 0.3 release at the PyTorch Summer Hackathon 2019. The new release focuses on standardization and compatibility with libraries like Kaldi, complex number support, a new transformation (resample), and more. #PTSH19 https://pytorch.org/",
